<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<codeSystem id="2.16.840.1.113883.3.1937.777.100.5.1" name="cs-specimen-label" displayName="Specimen label" effectiveDate="2026-08-27T00:00:00" statusCode="draft" experimental="true" caseSensitive="true" canonicalUri="http://synderai.net/fhir/CodeSystem/cs-specimen-label" lastModifiedDate="2026-09-11T00:00:00" language="en-US">
            <desc language="en-US">Local code system for specimen types whose LOINC System Part code is unknown or unverified. Every specimen type is addressable even where no LOINC Part code could be confirmed. The code is derived from the specimen label in the LOINC System column of the source table, reduced to letters and digits, with every other character replaced by an underscore and repeated
                underscores collapsed. The unmodified label is carried on the concept as the preferred designation. Where a LOINC System Part was verified against loinc.org, it is recorded on the concept as the property loincSystemPart. Two concepts, HEM and CHEM, are laboratory sections rather than specimen types. They are artefacts of the Synthea generation, carried here so that every value
                occurring in synthetic data is addressable, and the concept map records why their target is an interpretation.</desc>
            <desc language="de-DE">Lokales Codesystem für Probenarten, deren LOINC-System-Part unbekannt oder ungeprüft ist. Der Code wird aus dem Probenlabel der Spalte LOINC_System der Ausgangstabelle abgeleitet und auf Buchstaben und Ziffern reduziert. Alle übrigen Zeichen werden durch einen Unterstrich ersetzt, aufeinanderfolgende Unterstriche zusammengefasst. Das unveränderte Label steht als
                bevorzugte Designation am Konzept.</desc>
            <publishingAuthority name="SYNDERAI">
                <addrLine type="uri">https://synderai.net</addrLine>
            </publishingAuthority>
            <copyright language="en-US">Labels are derived from the LOINC System axis. LOINC is copyright Regenstrief Institute, Inc. This artefact is not published by Regenstrief.</copyright>
            <property code="loincSystemPart" type="string" description="LOINC System Part code for this specimen, where one was confirmed on loinc.org with Part Type System. Absent where no System part could be verified."/>
